WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
07:00 — Garden phone. Garden morning: Hamid writes a story seed on his phone — offline is the point, no account wall between him and the line.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
11:00 — iPad expand. iPad expand turns the seed into a scene without uploading anything to a stranger’s cloud.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
17:00 — Laptop draft. Laptop draft gathers the day’s seeds into something that might become a chapter.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
18:00 — Laptop list. Ideas list on the laptop stays local; he owns the folder the way he owns the notebooks.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
18:30 — Phone. Phone locks. Offline won. The seed is still there.

